			"date": "2024-03-22T22:34:52.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://m.trisweb.com/@trisweb\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>trisweb</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> </p><p>It's not just their marketing site. All of Vercel's claims fall apart as soon as you open Chrome and turn network throttle to \"Fast 3G\": <a href=\"https://x.com/dmitriid/status/1735338533303259571\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">x.com/dmitriid/status/17353385</span><span class=\"invisible\">33303259571</span></a></p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
